Here is a short, simple program to set up your AT&T 473 printer.
Cut at the line indicated. Then "uudecode" the resulting file -
you should get set473.arc. Download to your PC (DOS) using a 
binary protocol. Then "unarc" the file with ARC5.12 to get
SET473.COM. This file should be 637 bytes long.

Venu P. Gopal, ihnp4!ihuxk!vg55611
